msgid "Recent Documents"
msgstr "Dokumen Terbaru"

#: privacy.cpp:103
msgid "Quick Start Menu"
msgstr "Menu Mula Segera"

#: privacy.cpp:105
msgid "Favorite Icons"
msgstr "Ikon Kegemaran"

#: privacy.cpp:107
msgid "Check all cleanup actions you would like to perform. These will be executed by pressing the button below"
msgstr "Periksa semua aktiviti pembersihan yang anda ingin laksanakan. Ini akan dilaksanakan dengan menekan butang di bawah."

#: privacy.cpp:108
msgid "Immediately performs the cleanup actions selected above"
msgstr "Serta merta melaksanakan pembersihan pada subjek dipilih"

#: privacy.cpp:110
msgid "Clears the history of commands run through the Run Command tool on the desktop"
msgstr "Membersihkan rekod arahan yang dijalankan menerusi alat Jalankan Arahan pada ruang kerja"

#: privacy.cpp:111
msgid "Clears all stored cookies set by websites"
msgstr "Membersihkan semua cecikut yang ditetapkan oleh laman web"

#: privacy.cpp:112
msgid "Clears the history of visited websites"
msgstr "Membersihkan rekod laman web yang telah dilawat"

#: privacy.cpp:113
msgid "Clears the clipboard contents stored by Klipper"
msgstr "Bersihkan kandungan papan klip yang disimpan oleh Klipper"

#: privacy.cpp:114
msgid "Clears the temporary cache of websites visited"
msgstr "Membersihkan simpanan sementara daripada laman web yang telah dilawat"

#: privacy.cpp:115
msgid "Clears values which were entered into forms on websites"
msgstr "Membersihkan nilai yang dimasukkan ke dalam borang di laman web"

#: privacy.cpp:116
msgid "Clears the list of recently used documents from the KDE applications menu"
msgstr "Membersihkan senarai dokumen yang baru digunakan daripada menu aplikasi KDE"

#: privacy.cpp:117
msgid "Clears the entries from the list of recently started applications"
msgstr "Membersihkan input daripada senarai aplikasi terbaru yang dijalankan sebelum ini"

#: privacy.cpp:118
msgid "Clears the FavIcons cached from visited websites"
msgstr "Membersihkan Favicons disimpan daripada laman web yang telah dilawat"

#: privacy.cpp:250
msgid "You are deleting data that is potentially valuable to you. Are you sure?"
msgstr "Anda memadam data yang berpotensi bernilai kepada anda. Adakah anda pasti?"

#: privacy.cpp:253
msgid "Starting cleanup..."
msgstr "Memulakan pembersihan..."

#: privacy.cpp:262
msgid "Clearing %1..."
msgstr "Membersihkan %1..."

#: privacy.cpp:294
msgid "Clearing of %1 failed"
msgstr "Pembersihan %1 gagal"

#: privacy.cpp:301
msgid "Clean up finished."
msgstr "Pembersihan selesai."

#: privacy.cpp:308
#, fuzzy
msgid "The privacy module allows a user to erase traces which KDE leaves on the system, such as command histories or browser caches."
msgstr ""
"Modul peribadi yang membenarkan pengguna memadam jejak yang KDE tinggalkan "
"pada sistem, seperti rekod arahan atau simpanan pelungsur."

